{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 24, :comments ["And the reason of <b>And they made upon the skirts of the robe pomegranates of teal and purple</b> is that they made the pomegranates to place them upon the skirts of the robe all around, and they made bells of pure gold, and they placed the bells inside the pomegranates before they put them on the robe, and so the bells were inside the pomegranates while detached, and they placed the pomegranates upon the skirts of the robe all around with the bells inside them. Therefore Scripture repeats \"inside the pomegranates\" twice, for they were inside them from the start and at the time when they hung them upon the skirts of the robe all around. And this too is a proof for what we explained in the pericope of <i>V'atah Tetzaveh</i> (Ramban on Exodus 28:31)."], :book :exodus, :voice :ramban, :lang :en, :chapter 39, :notes {0 "The repeated phrase 'inside the pomegranates' refers to Exodus 28:33 and 39:25–26, where בתוך הרמונים appears; the present verse (39:24) describes the actual making, which Ramban reads against the earlier prescription."}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T03:22:23.479892961Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}